<title>MEXICO: Mexico livestock report, feeder export price - USDA.</title>
<headline>Mexico livestock report, feeder export price - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA reported Tuesday that around 200 head were exported into the United States at one crossing point Monday.</p>
<p>Through Laredo, Texas, around 200 head were sold, although not enough to establish trend prices. Bulk of supply consisted of previously contracted steers weighing 300-500 lb.</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530. E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com))</p>
